# Belt-and-suspenders for any code-indexing tool pointed at this repo.
#
# Why this file exists (verified against code-review-graph 2.3.7 source,
# 2026-07-26): collect_all_files() prefers `git ls-files`, so gitignored
# secrets are normally skipped -- BUT it silently falls back to a full
# rglob("*") filesystem walk whenever git ls-files returns empty, and
# get_all_tracked_files() returns [] on missing git, timeout, decode error,
# AND on any non-zero git exit (returncode is never checked). Its default
# ignore list (DEFAULT_IGNORE_PATTERNS) covers build/dependency dirs only --
# it has NO secrets patterns. Today the keys happen to be safe because
# .json/.env are not in EXTENSION_TO_LANGUAGE, i.e. protection rests on a
# parser table that can change in any release. This file does not rely on it.
#
# This repo holds live OKX trading credentials (data/okx_*_keys.json) and an
# executor that can place real orders. Keep these exclusions.

# --- secrets / credentials (never index) ---
data/**
**/*.env
.env*
**/*key*.json
**/*keys*.json
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
*.pem
label_studio_data/**

# --- large / generated artifacts (no review value) ---
analysis/output/**
runs/**
datasets/**
models/**
logs/**
wandb/**

# --- vendored / virtualenvs not already covered by defaults ---
.venv*/**
.venv_label_studio/**
.venv-fo/**
.venv-tools/**
.claude/worktrees/**
